      "id": 336143762,
      "date": "2026-09-13T14:02:37.580Z",
      "body": "130 subscribers in 8 days. \n\nI started writing on Substack on 5 September 2026, without really knowing where this journey would take me.\n\nToday, there are 130 of you here.\n\nIt may be just a number, but to me, every subscriber represents a person who chose to spend a little bit of their time reading what I write. And that makes this milestone special.\n\nI started this space to share my thoughts, learn in public, explore ideas, and write about things that genuinely interest me — particularly around investing, IPO analysis, businesses, data, and the lessons I pick up along the way.\n\nThe most encouraging part has been seeing people not only read my articles but also share them, respond to them, and connect with me through them. Some of my LinkedIn connections have even become Substack subscribers, which has made this journey even more meaningful.\n\nSo, Thank You. \n\nThank you to the first 10, the first 50, and now all 130 subscribers who decided to join me.\n\nThis is only the beginning.\n\nI have a lot more to learn, research, question, and write about.\n\nNext milestone: 500. \n\nBut for today, I’m simply going to pause and say:\n\nThank you for being here. \n\n— Dhruti",
